WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
Can't Thief Huizong still be angry?

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:04,240
Do you think you can get rid of it? I'm getting a rash.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:08,650
The deepest part of the ancestral book

4
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:13,080
Catch me naked

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,080
How dare you bully my mother?

6
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,080
It’s my turn to be a thief and I’ve been harmed by him.

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:28,300
Fang Xi Won't Indulge Ming Feng to Trouble the Ancestor Emperor

8
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,300
Causing the ancestral books to wither

9
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,300
No longer worthy of being a queen

10
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,190
If you want to seize the position, just say so.

11
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:38,190
No need to use a child as an excuse

12
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:40,190
after today
